<title>USA: Pegasus says Zortman consent entered.</title>
<headline>Pegasus says Zortman consent entered.</headline>
<dateline>SPOKANE, Wash. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pegasus Gold Inc said on Monday that the consent decree that settles lawsuits concerning water quality issues at the company's Zortman mine has been filed by U.S. and Montana regulators and entered into record.</p>
<p>It is expected that a Record of Decision will be issued shortly, Pegasus Gold said in a statement.</p>
</text>
